sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Usuario / Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI API
    participant JobStore as IngestJobStore
    participant RAG as RAGApplication
    participant Ingest as IngestionService
    participant VS as ChromaDB Vector Store
    participant Chain as RAG Chain
    participant LLM as Ollama

    User->>API: GET /health
    API-->>User: 200 OK (liveness, version, timestamp)

    User->>API: GET /info
    API->>RAG: read current config and local state
    RAG->>VS: check persisted vectorstore
    VS-->>RAG: exists / missing
    RAG-->>API: runtime info
    API-->>User: 200 OK (model, dirs, chunk config)

    User->>API: GET /health/ready
    API->>RAG: check vectorstore_exists and chain cache
    RAG->>VS: verify vectorstore path
    VS-->>RAG: exists / missing
    RAG-->>API: ready/not_ready + chain_ready
    alt Vectorstore exists
        API-->>User: 200 Ready
    else Vectorstore missing
        API-->>User: 503 Not Ready
    end

    opt Initial ingestion when vectorstore is missing or stale
        User->>API: POST /ingest
        API->>JobStore: create queued job
        JobStore-->>API: job_id
        API-->>User: 202 Accepted (job_id)

        API->>RAG: apply overrides from request
        API->>Ingest: start background ingestion
        Ingest->>JobStore: mark running
        Ingest->>Ingest: load docs and split into chunks
        Ingest->>LLM: create embeddings model client
        Ingest->>VS: persist chunks and embeddings
        VS-->>Ingest: persisted
        Ingest->>JobStore: mark done or failed

        loop Poll until done
            User->>API: GET /ingest/{job_id}
            API->>JobStore: read job status
            JobStore-->>API: queued/running/done/failed
            API-->>User: job state + timestamps + error
        end
    end

    User->>API: POST /query
    API->>RAG: ensure ready and apply query overrides
    RAG->>VS: load retriever from vectorstore
    RAG->>Chain: get or build chain
    Chain->>VS: retrieve top-k relevant chunks
    VS-->>Chain: source documents
    Chain->>LLM: generate grounded answer
    LLM-->>Chain: final answer
    Chain-->>RAG: answer + sources + metrics
    RAG-->>API: structured query response
    API-->>User: 200 OK (answer, sources, response_time)

    User->>API: POST /chat/stream
    API->>RAG: ensure ready
    RAG->>Chain: get existing or rebuilt chain
    Chain->>VS: retrieve relevant chunks
    VS-->>Chain: source documents
    Chain->>LLM: stream generation
    loop For each token
        LLM-->>Chain: token chunk
        Chain-->>API: token chunk
        API-->>User: SSE data: {"token":"...","done":false}
    end
    API-->>User: SSE data: {"token":"","done":true}
